# Pages only: every act on a person's page. Not complete.
screen Home
  inbox
  me: identity, person
  list Contacts: everyone; shows knows; opens Person
  Establish

screen Person(p)
  Acquaint: Bob = p
  Befriend: Bob = p
  Unfriend: Bob = p
  Introduce: Bob = p, Carol = pick of knows
  Introduce: Carol = p, Bob = pick of knows
